18
00:10:04,000 --> 00:10:06,120
B parametresi ve R parametresi

19
00:10:06,120 --> 00:10:08,000
var. Fakat burada uygulamalarda

20
00:10:08,000 --> 00:10:09,500
A ve B parametresini

21
